<div class="container py-5">
 <h1 class="fw-bold mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
 <p class="text-muted">Last updated: August 2026</p>
 <p>Attendly respects your privacy. This policy describes how we handle your data.</p>
 <h5>Data We Collect</h5>
 <p>We collect information you provide during registration such as your name, email, college, and course information.</p>
 <h5>How We Use Data</h5>
 <p>Your data is used solely to provide the Attendly platform services. We do not sell or share your personal data with third parties.</p>
 <h5>Data Storage</h5>
 <p>All data is stored securely on Supabase PostgreSQL with appropriate access controls.</p>
 <h5>Contact</h5>
 <p>For privacy concerns, contact us at @AppConfig.SupportEmail.</p>
</div>
